The generated kernel/src/mc_tri_table.hpp table is derived from the local PCL
1.12 header /usr/include/pcl-1.12/pcl/surface/marching_cubes.h. PCL distributes
this code under the BSD 3-Clause license and attributes the classic Marching
Cubes tables to Paul Bourke's polygonise implementation.

